note S5 scrub inside an inline function written before a global: the inline body is compiled at its call
note site in main, after the global, so the scrub restores the global's pins (pinlo) under both omc
note 0d7f2f42 and the fix. A control for the ordering: exit 0.
om2
fn clean to ulong inline
k = scrub 64
ret ulong k
end
global g ulong 5000
fn main to int
j = ulong 4999
put g j 5
k = clean
y = get g j
if ne y 5
ret 2
end
ret int k
end
